[00:09.14]Hello. Can I help you?
[00:10.82]Hi. Yes, where can I find toothbrushes?
[00:15.32]They’re just there on your right.
[00:17.64]Oh yes. I didn’t see them. OK, I’ll take this one.
[00:22.68]Is that all?
[00:23.86]No, there’s this toothpaste, too.
[00:26.56]OK. So that’s £4.30.
[00:30.74]Here you are.
[00:31.25]And that’s 70p change. Have a nice day.
[00:35.63]Thank you.
[00:41.80]Are you all right there?
[00:43.58]Yes, thanks. I just want a cover for my new phone. Have you got this one in red?
[00:49.50]Sorry, only black.
[00:51.70]OK, black’s fine. I’ll take it.
[00:54.28]Right. That’s twelve ninety-nine please.
[00:58.58]Can I pay with my contactless card?
[01:01.08]Of course. Just place it over here.
[01:04.96]OK.
[01:06.20]Great. That’s gone through. Would you like your receipt?
[01:10.86]No, it’s OK.
[01:17.94]Do you need any help?
[01:20.06]Hi. These trousers – can I try them on, please?
[01:24.72]Sure. What size do you take?
[01:28.02]Not sure. 28 or 30.
[01:32.54]And do you want them in red? We’ve got other colours, too.
[01:36.96]Yes, I saw them but it’s the red ones I’m interested in.
[01:41.16]No problem. So why don’t you try both sizes? The changing rooms are in the corner.
[01:48.63]Thanks!
[01:55.52]Can I help you?
[01:56.84]Yeah. These football socks. How much are they? I can’t find the price.
[02:02.30]Just a moment. They’re eight ninety-nine.
[02:07.04]Fine. I’ll take them.
[02:08.67]OK, is that cash or card?
[02:11.83]Cash.
[02:12.89]That’s great and here’s your change and receipt.
[02:17.22]Thanks.
